flowchart LR
    User[Utilisateur] --> Web[Frontend React]
    Web --> Gateway[Spring Cloud Gateway :8080]
    RestClient[Client REST] --> Gateway

    subgraph Business[Microservices metier]
        Accounts[account-service :8081]
        Transactions[transaction-service :8082]
        AccountDB[(Base comptes H2)]
        TransactionDB[(Base transactions H2)]
        Accounts --> AccountDB
        Transactions --> TransactionDB
        Transactions -->|OpenFeign + Resilience4J| Accounts
    end

    Gateway -->|REST / GraphQL| Accounts
    Gateway -->|REST / GraphQL| Transactions
    Gateway --> Assistant[chatbot-service :8083]
    Assistant -->|Spring AI| Gemini[Gemini API]
    Assistant -->|MCP Streamable HTTP| Accounts
    Assistant -->|MCP Streamable HTTP| Transactions

    Transactions -->|TransactionCreated / cle accountId| Kafka[Kafka : bank.transactions.created]
    Kafka --> Consumer[event-consumer :8084]
    Consumer --> Logs[Journalisation seule]

    Eureka[Eureka Discovery :8761] -. decouverte .-> Gateway
    Eureka -. decouverte .-> Transactions
    Accounts -. enregistrement .-> Eureka
    Transactions -. enregistrement .-> Eureka
    Assistant -. enregistrement .-> Eureka
    Config[Config Server :8888] -. plafond partage 1000 .-> Accounts
    Config -. plafond partage 1000 .-> Transactions
